# Where the stress goes when the word does not end the way Castilian's rule
# expects.
#
# assign_span_stress decides between the last syllable and the one before it
# by looking at the last phone: a vowel, or an n or an s with a vowel before
# it, takes the penultimate, and anything else takes the last. It asks about
# the n by its code, and Catalan's word-final n is not that code -- it is the
# interdental's, taken over so that span_phrase_level_rules would stop
# velarising it, which ss_val.up and docs/status.md set out. So every word
# ending in an n fell through to the last syllable: canten came out
# [k @ n t e n] where Catalan says [k a n t @ n], and with it every third
# person plural there is, which is most of the verbs anyone says.
#
# The voiced s is the same fault one letter along, and it arrived with the
# rule that voices a word-final s in front of the next word: escoles on its
# own is [@ s k O l @ s] and escoles i taules came out [@ s k u l e z], the
# stress a syllable to the right, because the last phone was no longer the s
# the test asks for. It is caught here beside the n.
#
# The test belongs in assign_span_stress, beside the ones for n and s, and it
# cannot go there: those three are one shared wrapper apiece and the same
# wrapper is what the velarising arm reads, so widening it would undo the very
# thing the retaking was for. What can be done is to catch it at the other
# end. span_final_str is the arm that was wrongly taken, it is nine operations
# long, and a word that ends in the final n with a vowel in front of it is
# handed to span_penult_str instead.
#
# The rest is IBM's rule operation for operation: the pointer the word ends
# at, the scan set leftward over the syllables, one step, the mark, and the
# two places a backtrack comes back to -- the second of which is planted by
# savescptr rather than by anything here, which is why it is bound to its
# number rather than allocated one.
rule span_final_str takes 1 from st_strss.obj
  local at bytes 8
  variable word_end word 872
  call push_ptr_init addr at
  call ZZfence_null
  call ZZlpta_load_vvg__setscan_0108l__4
  if answer is 0
    call cat_test_final_n                          # a word-final n?
    if answer is 0
      call ZZtestFldeq4_1_1                        # with a vowel before it?
      if answer is 0
        call span_penult_str
        if answer is 0
          match
        end
        give up
      end
    end
  end
  call ZZlpta_load_vvg__setscan_0108l__4
  if answer is 0
    call cat_test_final_z                          # or a word-final voiced s?
    if answer is 0
      call ZZtestFldeq4_1_1                        # with a vowel before it?
      if answer is 0
        call span_penult_str
        if answer is 0
          match
        end
        give up
      end
    end
  end
  plant test put_mark
  call lpta_loadp addr word_end
  call setscan_l 7
  if answer is 0
    call advance_tok
    if answer is 0
      go to saved
    end
  end
  go to put_mark
place saved on 2
  call ZZsavescptr2 addr at
place put_mark
  call ZZlprp_load__insert_2pt_i_7_2_ZZstring3 addr at addr word_end
  if answer is not 0
    backtrack
  end
  call succeed
  answer 0
end
